      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cadwell%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cadwell sits at 32°20′25″N 83°2′33″W, placing it in southwestern Laurens County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
