      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cadwell%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Georgia State Route 117 runs through Cadwell’s Main Street, linking it 17 miles northeast to Dublin and 13 miles southwest to Eastman.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cadwell%2C_Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "State Route 126 cuts through Cadwell’s center as Burch Street, heading northwest 8 miles to Chester and southeast 22 miles to Alamo.",
